{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3343483","kind":"blog","title":"【活动】2016克罗地亚音乐会","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-05-08","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Croatia Music!","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3343483/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录一次克罗地亚音乐会之行，聆听作曲家多拉·佩雅切维奇的作品，并为两位音乐家的演奏深受触动。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · Croatia Music!","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3343483.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160510130634id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3343483.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n天才钢琴家\n\n安达君邀请我\n\n去听了\n\n克罗地亚音乐会！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3343483/001-46a2746874.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3343483/001-46a2746874.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"745\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n在 Engine01 活动中也一直承蒙关照的\n\n音乐记者\n\n池田卓夫先生担任导聆！\n\n\n<br>\n\n听到了许多深入的讲解……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n克罗地亚作曲家\n\n多拉·佩雅切维奇\n\n<br>\n\n她是一位女性作曲家\n\n了解到她复杂的人生\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n克罗地亚小提琴家\n\n戈兰·孔恰尔\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n\n钢琴家\n\n安达朋博\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n热爱克罗地亚的两个人\n\n奏响的音乐！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n受到满满的刺激！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真的\n\n太精彩了！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n怀抱爱意的天才们\n奏响的音乐是最强的！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n天才ピアニストの\n\n安達くんに招待してもらい\n\nクロアチア音楽のコンサートに\n\n行って来ました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3343483/001-46a2746874.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3343483/001-46a2746874.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"520\" height=\"745\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nエンジン01でもお世話になっている\n\n音楽ジャーナリストの\n\n池田卓夫さんがナビゲーター！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n深い話を聞いて・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nクロアチア人の作曲家\n\nドラ・ペヤチェヴィッチ \n\n<br>\n\n\n女性の作曲家ですが\n\n彼女の複雑な人生を\n\n知って・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nクロアチアのヴァイオリ二スト\n\nゴラン・コンチャル\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\nピア二スト\n\n安達  朋博\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nクロアチアを愛する2人が\n奏でる音楽！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n刺激\n受けまくり！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n本当に\n\n素晴らしかったです！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n愛を持った天才たちが\n奏でる音楽は最強です！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}